; NOTE: do NOT set `prefix` here. This file is also the project-level .npmrc
; when the cwd is ~/.dotfiles, and npm refuses `prefix` from project config
; ("prefix cannot be changed from project config").
;
; The npm global prefix is set via the NPM_CONFIG_PREFIX environment variable:
;   - ~/.config/zsh/misc/30_commands.zsh
;   - ~/.config/environment.d/10-wayland.conf
